[{"client_msg_id":"77466b1b-849b-432d-bed0-0384a01f4826","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私はいまだに聞こえるので街中を歩いているとたまに不快な音に苛まれますね。\nただそれはまだ有毛細胞がへたってない証でもあるので、ちょっと安心する気持ちもあり。","ts":"1626444785.025400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1VoT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf616190-4b3d-4f86-b405-3df0de1c09c5","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"既にモスキート音は聞こえません。便利。","ts":"1626444295.024200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nxYx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c47a37c-6edf-4973-a42f-2f5c762b18f5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"感覚器はいろいろ大変だよね、経年劣化もあるし...","ts":"1626439108.023300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oKJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0683a688-6925-4abe-9504-c27f9c135a40","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自分は以前ちょっとだけ耳に違和感を覚えたこととか、軽い耳慣りっぽい症状はあったけど、今は問題ないな...","ts":"1626438834.022800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Aq5m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f433160-bc47-4f85-acdb-7470eae33ec1","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"耳がデフォで片方聞こえないので突発性難聴が本当に怖い\n残機が一つしかない","ts":"1626438581.021300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":7,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UAZ33BKV2","U81LLJ340","U7TMPGWJ0","U76GA7MFA","U017BU3UZBQ","U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PE4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ebd12f33-bddc-4e50-a527-a037ab7d779c","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"ドラムやってるから耳栓は手放せない","ts":"1626436817.020600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vjM/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3246067D-66F3-4A73-80E1-0898292CA303","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"書籍でもチラ見してみます \u003chttps://www.google.co.jp/amp/s/prtimes.jp/main/html/rd/amp/p/000000091.000033602.html|https://www.google.co.jp/amp/s/prtimes.jp/main/html/rd/amp/p/000000091.000033602.html\u003e","ts":"1626434707.020000","attachments":[{"fallback":"プレスリリース・ニュースリリース配信シェアNo.1｜PR TIMES: フジテレビ「梅ズバ」出演で大反響！　15万人超の耳を治療してきた整体師が、朝起きて寝るまでにできる耳にいいことを書き尽くす。『いつでもどこでも耳がよくなる小さ...","id":1,"title":"フジテレビ「梅ズバ」出演で大反響！　15万人超の耳を治療してきた整体師が、朝起きて寝るまでにできる耳にいいことを書き尽くす。『いつでもどこでも耳がよくなる小さ...","title_link":"https://www.google.co.jp/amp/s/prtimes.jp/main/html/rd/amp/p/000000091.000033602.html","text":"株式会社　大和書房のプレスリリース（2019年3月15日 16時00分）フジテレビ[梅ズバ]出演で大反響！　15万人超の耳を治療してきた整体師が、朝起きて寝るまでにできる耳にいいことを書き尽くす。『いつでもどこでも耳がよくなる小さな習慣』今野清志著","image_url":"https://prtimes.jp/i/33602/91/ogp/d33602-91-863598-0.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"プレスリリース・ニュースリリース配信シェアNo.1｜PR TIMES","service_icon":"https://prtimes.jp/common/v4.1/images/html/favicon/apple-touch-icon-114x114.png","from_url":"https://www.google.co.jp/amp/s/prtimes.jp/main/html/rd/amp/p/000000091.000033602.html","original_url":"https://www.google.co.jp/amp/s/prtimes.jp/main/html/rd/amp/p/000000091.000033602.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"awd8/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A0B8BC5F-42DD-463E-8374-5911C03D1DDC","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"音が歪んで聞こえるようならば耳栓はある程度有効かも\nなんか鼓膜が勝手に動いている感覚だったりしません？","ts":"1626434278.019300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hJ5l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DABE065B-2ACE-4CB7-92A4-86DB70ADB317","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ちなみに今は耳鳴りもしてます。これはこれでうざいのでストレスフル！","ts":"1626434115.017100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hiee","count":5,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U81LLJ340","U9S4G0LJW","U7TMPGWJ0","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fxz9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BFE44D4F-4BAD-4A9D-BA41-083A6F4194B4","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"聴力に良いとされることを全てやってみるしかないってところなのですかね、やはり。","ts":"1626433467.016900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+oqG3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb5b2912-cb4e-48ef-97b3-089503850054","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"アルコールは自律神経を狂わせるので本来なら飲むべきではない（でも好きなので飲んじゃう）","ts":"1626433125.015600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rch"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81be80b1-423e-4fbc-9d5f-a80bd036afab","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"意外と耳のトラブルって多いんですね…","ts":"1626432904.013500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xIO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bc464d0-2fe4-450c-af28-23b015bd840c","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"もっと良い病院に行ったほうが良いのかもしれない。","ts":"1626432659.013000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9lUF2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98fa5bf9-fe01-4fdf-b8b2-e236265a49c9","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"酒をたくさん飲んだり、ライブ行ったりして耳に負荷がかかると、右耳が息を吹きかけられたような状態になります。こちらは病院に行っても処置なしな感じでした。","ts":"1626432633.012900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tO="}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7fe5483-dea2-40c4-b8ae-d8fa73e06976","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"四六時中耳鳴りしてますけど病院に行って薬飲んでも改善しなかったので放置してます。意識しなかったら気にならないので。","ts":"1626432453.012800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rg1="}]},{"client_msg_id":"f073b569-5858-4c5f-a6f0-30f33552567f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"メンタル本当にだいじ","ts":"1626432326.012700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Iqe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7596aa87-b18e-4519-a983-18440d4a3a8f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"起き上がると気分が悪くなるので何もできなくてつらかった","ts":"1626432311.012500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9DIr3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"492a85dd-4491-4cfc-9672-94342b861363","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"耳鳴りは来たことないけどメンタルやられていた時には三半規管が逝って視界が体感的にぐるんぐるん回って歩けなかったな","ts":"1626432296.012100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Gnck"}]},{"client_msg_id":"983182D3-A6E9-4832-8A93-82A6FDC56E01","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"（それだ！）","ts":"1626432209.011100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GCS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd763c08-56ca-41ef-8627-8d1a94dd3262","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"[規則正しい生活 方法][検索]","ts":"1626432186.010400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaranai","count":2,"users":["U81LLJ340","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Mls"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22a8e1bd-ae12-489d-9520-9602f8d0f8b1","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"やっぱ規則正しい生活とメンタル的な部分の調整とが大事なんですかね…\nいまだに出来ていないことだけれど…","ts":"1626432140.009700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tXmeX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FE7F035B-333F-44F1-A434-1E32A82087E7","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"実は身内でちょうど同じ症状な人がいまして...","ts":"1626432049.008200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KW="}]},{"client_msg_id":"B2DF3BED-CA68-46A3-84DF-6AFF57D44F6C","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"マッサージとか効果ありますか？","ts":"1626431974.007100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vg27T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7C87DBDD-77CF-478F-A57F-C62DA4775D88","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"補聴器が必要なレベルくらい片耳の聴力が一時的に悪くなったりするみたいですしね...","ts":"1626431932.006000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4WcLO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A015612D-2755-4DB7-8E18-7D7A1A44E877","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"emteeさんは薬で治ったんですか？","ts":"1626431768.000100","thread_ts":"1626431768.000100","reply_count":4,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=leuR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"163044A9-FFEF-4051-90B7-61947828B99D","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"原因がいまいち明確にならないのが厄介なところ\n(いまは診断プロセスが進歩しているのかもだけれど)\n\n自律神経系だったりウイルス性だったり、自分の場合は結局原因不明でしたね","ts":"1626431068.499000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iyUdr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff132c1f-1905-4200-98f3-776cb1f5d9a6","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"~ラノベ主人公の突発性難聴なら良いんですけどね~","ts":"1626430836.494500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CLSpg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8f585c1-f25f-448a-b5cb-915f967a142c","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"なるほど…！突発性難聴の怖い噂は時々聞きますからね…\n気をつけます","ts":"1626430644.493600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cBGG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93cbceb2-60a5-44fd-b6ab-42aa65bbea8f","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"多少は自分もありますが、明らかに通常と違うなと感じるのであれば早めに診療されるのをお勧めします…。","ts":"1626430188.492900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nt3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd37c05b-081d-4584-8fa3-738296db53dc","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"多少耳鳴りがすることはたまにあるんだけどこれは大丈夫なのかな…","ts":"1626430117.492200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KMbA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c205393-8cfc-4c56-b280-d1fa31611f2e","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"自分も聞きづらいことが起きるので(その度に病院に行って検査してる)、今回もそれだろ(内耳が浮腫んでるそう)と思ってたんですが、意外とまずそうなやつでした。\n前回検査した時の聴力検査の数値が病院にあるので(前回も調子悪い時に検査したやつ)、それよりさらに悪い数値が出たので早めに行ってよかったです。","ts":"1626430108.491900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4rkV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81cb711a-c262-4d98-b07d-11681682e512","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"突発性難聴って怖いんですね\n年に数回は酷い耳鳴りと目眩に襲われるんですが，一晩寝れば回復するので放置してました","ts":"1626429620.487300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HF+K"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"少しバランス良くなってきた","ts":"1626428254.486100","files":[{"id":"F028NLKSQE5","created":1626428232,"timestamp":1626428232,"name":"image.png","title":"image.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"UDDCM376D","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":118939,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F028NLKSQE5/image.png","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F028NLKSQE5/download/image.png","original_h":444,"original_w":1224,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F028NLKSQE5-2a1b0d5c9f/image_64.png","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F028NLKSQE5-2a1b0d5c9f/image_80.png","thumb_160":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F028NLKSQE5-2a1b0d5c9f/image_160.png","thumb_360":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F028NLKSQE5-2a1b0d5c9f/image_360.png","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":360,"thumb_360_h":131,"thumb_480":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F028NLKSQE5-2a1b0d5c9f/image_480.png","thumb_480_w":480,"thumb_480_h":174,"thumb_720":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F028NLKSQE5-2a1b0d5c9f/image_720.png","thumb_720_w":720,"thumb_720_h":261,"thumb_960":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F028NLKSQE5-2a1b0d5c9f/image_960.png","thumb_960_w":960,"thumb_960_h":348,"thumb_1024":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F028NLKSQE5-2a1b0d5c9f/image_1024.png","thumb_1024_w":1024,"thumb_1024_h":371,"permalink":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/files/UDDCM376D/F028NLKSQE5/image.png","permalink_public":"https://slack-files.com/T03C4RC8V-F028NLKSQE5-0deb633372","edit_link":"","preview":"","preview_highlight":"","lines":0,"lines_more":0,"is_public":true,"public_url_shared":false,"channels":null,"groups":null,"ims":null,"initial_comment":{},"comments_count":0,"num_stars":0,"is_starred":false,"shares":{"public":null,"private":null},"display_as_bot":false,"has_rich_preview":false,"thumb_800":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F028NLKSQE5-2a1b0d5c9f/image_800.png","thumb_800_h":290,"thumb_800_w":800,"thumb_tiny":"AwARADC+Ny+vJ7807f7GhulIOD7UAOJOOAaaS3YfpTsg0HoPrQA3L4+nXijcwHTOOvFL2P1obo1ADqSlpKAClpKWgBKKKKAP/9k=","username":""}],"reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":1,"users":["U023FDA0AKC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"86K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6B298BFC-7DB2-4620-AC3B-AC41DE824E01","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"私は耳鳴りタイプだったな…。高い音が全部歪んで聞こえるようになってた\nけっこうメンタル的にもしんどくなるので、なるはやで診てもらうのがいいと思います","ts":"1626424993.485000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sVbtl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D7792BC5-7543-404C-956D-6E7D3B3A3CDF","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"今日、カップ焼きそばを食べようとして湯気が耳にかかった瞬間に耳鳴りがしたので、湯気と耳鳴りの相関性を調べたけど何も情報が出てこなかった（完）","ts":"1626424898.482900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"As0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba31764d-000f-4486-9809-9c416c93dc41","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"2週間とか1ヶ月で状態が良くならなければ長いお付き合いになるみたいなお話も聞きますね","ts":"1626424555.479300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dhUoF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3d1ddc4-c637-4cb4-90a7-f574fbce6226","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"突発性難聴、心配...。耳鳴りがしたりする人もいるみたいですしね...","ts":"1626424487.478000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pGI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51a6841e-ac0e-4b41-b55d-b262275bd65d","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"はい。突発性難聴は治療が遅れると本当に聴力低下したり、別の病気（難病もある）の初期症状だったりするので早めに医者にいくべきですね。\n自分も、３ヶ月ぐらい右耳が全くきこえなくなりました","ts":"1626422097.476200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"60+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb453792-00c9-4ad9-895b-c0e2aee93742","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ヤバい","ts":"1626421958.474500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TVi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F48A078F-7968-4E91-A057-1A4CD010E266","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"朝起きたら方耳が聞き取りにくくなって(今までもたまに起きた)左右のバランス悪くて気持ち悪いから病院来たら、突発性難聴までは行かないけど、それに準じた治療すると言われたでござる。\n突発性難聴は時間との勝負って言われたので耳が聞き取りにくくなったら早く病院来てねとのことでした。","ts":"1626421609.473800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hiee","count":10,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U017BU3UZBQ","U06ECBRTJ","U7JL1UKKL","U81LLJ340","UDDCM376D","UL6CFN8NR","U7TMPGWJ0","UFHQ7TNT0","U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"odaijini","count":14,"users":["U06ECBRTJ","U011FTGJ3SN","UAZ33BKV2","U81LLJ340","U01AQ5BFNLX","U013QL1RAPN","UDDCM376D","U017BU3UZBQ","U01PMN2BVJQ","UL6CFN8NR","U7TMPGWJ0","U9S4G0LJW","UBNPMJJGM","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ol72"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0007fac3-bab7-4c94-8ed7-a47f0b1df9de","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"集団接種の予約は来週からですね　できるのかはわからんけど","ts":"1626394904.469500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XCgDX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b6a2f36-90f3-463e-b29e-9b27e57045bd","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"まあだろうなと…どこもそんなもんですか","ts":"1626394824.468800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pVRDV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d402fdf8-3583-4b2a-b1a2-a0cbcc64b7b4","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"接種券すでに来てるけど、同じくまだ予約不可。あと予約は取れないだろうという地元民の見解。","ts":"1626394009.468200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wa="}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e07f505-6660-4dba-b151-584c6fd55dbc","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"外にでなければセーフか？","ts":"1626393495.467500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"znsWX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a3aa389-be2e-4216-9e8e-85a6e7c43e1a","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"接種券そもそも来てないけど、ワクチン不足なうちは接種できる気がしない","ts":"1626393490.467200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vYD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EC49AB71-4F0B-4D64-A6CF-D5C7A6A0EE56","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"うちの市は接種券来たけど月末まで予約開始されない…","ts":"1626392705.466400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+ED6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b79ef18c-ff66-4b12-9906-7ca6ae3805ca","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"接種券手に入れたけど、昨日はどこに掛けても通話中で繋がらなかった\n今日も予約チャレンジしないと","ts":"1626391354.465100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QRLCm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FC2CDECC-6141-4FE1-804A-4EB23D2DA9A6","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"いちおう抗生物質を処方されたような\nただ、ちょうどその頃仕事でストレスフルな状態だったので自律神経失調症だったのかもなーといったところです","ts":"1626431853.001800","thread_ts":"1626431768.000100","parent_user_id":"U7TMPGWJ0","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sefgc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CB559AED-AA35-428A-BC19-689D14FDFE11","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"なるほど、参考になります。","ts":"1626431880.003000","thread_ts":"1626431768.000100","parent_user_id":"U7TMPGWJ0","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7H1a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"767FA027-8E34-4CFA-B0C6-67357C0AD1D7","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"いまでも疲れてくると若干耳に蓋が被さった感じになるので、疲労のバロメータ的に利用していますね\n寛解したときの聴力検査ではむしろ人よりも聴こえが良い方だという結果でした","ts":"1626431969.006800","thread_ts":"1626431768.000100","parent_user_id":"U7TMPGWJ0","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qAj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5E5806D7-0823-4578-A3FE-D9A2B7439B07","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"詰まったような症状...まさにそれですね...","ts":"1626432141.009900","thread_ts":"1626431768.000100","parent_user_id":"U7TMPGWJ0","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cht"}]}]
